    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023030/extras/0ba8b33cf84dab0340fe8f546d3dc3af.poster.avif?t=1561709707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023030/extras/0ba8b33cf84dab0340fe8f546d3dc3af.webm?t=1561709707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023030/extras/0ba8b33cf84dab0340fe8f546d3dc3af.mp4?t=1561709707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It was just like everyday.<br><br>Until when everything changed.<br><br>A beautiful yet strange world appeared as she decided to look around.<br><br>What will happen in this place?<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023030/extras/cfd177d6d6d3599f7f6b18c399820cd5.avif?t=1561709707\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An adventurous, story-based game </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Filled with grotesque and fearful factors </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Captivating graphics and scenes </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Decorate the house if you wish to know the girl's past </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A mysterious story hidden in various events </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>It is up to you to decide how her journey will end </li></ul>",
